2a &= 2 \\
a &= 1
\end{align*}

Substituting $a = 1$ into the first equation, we get:

\begin{align*}
1 + b &= 3 \\
b &= 2
\end{align*}

Therefore, the remainder is $\boxed{ +  2.$

