$$\frac{\frac{1}{a} + \frac{1}{b} + \frac{1}{c}}{\frac{1}{a + b} + \frac{1}{a + c} + \frac{1}{b + c}} \ge \frac{3}{2}.$$

Therefore, the minimum value of the expression is $\boxed{\frac{3}{2}}$.
