Using the difference of squares formula, we get:

\[(\sqrt 5+\sqrt6+\sqrt7)(-\sqrt 5+\sqrt6+\sqrt7) = 5+\sqrt6+\sqrt7)(\sqrt 5+\sqrt6-\sqrt7) = 2 isboxedboxedboxed2}.\]
