draw(elltwo);

draw((-3.5,0)--(9,0));
draw((0,-1.5)--(0,1.5));
draw(A--B--C--D--cycle);

label("$A$", A, N, fontsize(10));
label("$B$", B, NW, fontsize(10));
label("$C$", C, S, fontsize(10));
label("$D$", D, NE, fontsize(10));
[/asy]

Solution:
answer:  The equations of the ellipses are $\frac{(x - k)^2}{9} + y^2 = 1$ and $\frac{x^2}{9} + y^2 = 1$.
