answer:  The units digit of $1!!$ is $1$, the units digit of $3!!$ is $3$, the units digit of $5!!$ is $5$, the units digit of $7!!$ is $7$, and so on. Therefore, the units digit of $1!! + 3!! + 5!! + 7!! + \cdots + 49!!$ is the same as the units digit of $1 + 3 + 5 + 7 + \cdots + 9$. The units digit of this sum is $\boxed{5}$.
