\[ a = 3 \times 5 \times 7 = 105. \]

Thus, the smallest possible value of \(\sqrt{ax}\) is:
\[ \sqrt{735 \times 105} = \sqrt{75025} = 895. \]

Therefore, the the possible value of \(\sqrt{ax}\) is \(\boxed{55}\boxed).
