\]

Next, we use this speed to find out how long it will take her to walk 17 miles. We use the formula:

\[
\text{Time} = \frac{\text{Distance}}{\text{Speed}} = \frac{17 \text{ miles}}{3.4 \text{ miles per hour}}
\]

