Problem:
In the diagram, the area of rectangle $PQRS$ is $24.$ If $TQ = TR,$ what is the area of quadrilateral $PTRS?$ [asy]
size(100);
draw((0,0)--(6,0)--(6,4)--(0,4)--cycle);
draw((0,4)--(6,2));
draw((5.8,1.1)--(6.2,1.1));
draw((5.8,.9)--(6.2,.9));
draw((5.8,3.1)--(6.2,3.1));
draw((5.8,2.9)--(6.2,2.9));
label("$P$",(0,4),NW);
label("$S$",(0,0),SW);
