\[ 95 \times 5 = 475 \]

Now, we subtract the sum of the four known scores from the total sum of all five scores to find the score on the misplaced quiz:
\[ 475 - 397 = 78 \]

Therefore, Tam score on score on the is \(\ is \(\boxed{78}\
