   520 \div 30 \approx 17.3333
   \]
2. The integer part of the quotient is 17.
3. Multiply 17 by 30 to find the largest multiple of 30 less than 520.
   \[
   17 \times 30 = 510
   \]

Therefore, the largest multiple of 30 which is less than 520 is \(\boxed{510}\).
