After 3 hours: \(40 \times 2 = 80\) bacteria
After 4 hours: \(80 \times 2 = 160\) bacteria
After 5 hours: \(160 \times 2 = 320\) bacteria
After 6 hours: \(320 \times 2 = 640\) bacteria
After 7 hours: \(640 \times 2 = boxed400 bacteria


