\[ --8 + (-7) + (-6) + (-5) + (-4) + (-3) + 0 + 1 + 2 + 3 \]

Calculate the sum:
\[ -8 - 7 - 6 - 5 - 4 - 3 + 0 + 1 + 2 + 3 = -28 \]

Therefore, the sum of all the possible solutions is:
\[ \boxed{-22} \]boxed is
