$$\mathbf{c} = \begin{pmatrix} -2k \\ 5k \end{pmatrix} + t \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}.$$

Simplifying, we have

$$\mathbf{c} = \begin{pmatrix} -2k + t \\ 5k + 3 \end{pmatrix}.$$


