Solution:
answer:  We can write the line as
\[\begin{pmatrix} x \\ y \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 7 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix} + t \mathbf{d},\]where $\mathbf{d}$ is a constant vector.  We want the distance between $\begin{pmatrix} x \\ y \end{pmatrix}$ and $\begin{pmatrix} 7 \\ -2 \end{pmatrix}$ to be $t.$  This means that
