Solution:
answer:  To compute the dot product of the vectors \(\begin{pmatrix} -3 \\ 5 \end{pmatrix}\) and \(\begin{pmatrix} -2 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}\), we use the formula for the dot product of two vectors \(\begin{pmatrix} a_1 \\ a_2 \end{pmatrix}\) and \(\begin{pmatrix} b_1 \\ b_2 \end{pmatrix}\), which is given by:

\[
a_1 b_1 + a_2 b_2
\]

