This implies that $x$ must be a multiple of $60^\circ$. Therefore, the values of $x$ that satisfy the equation are $120^\circ$, $180^\circ$, and $240^\circ$.

The sum of these values is $120^\circ + 180^\circ + 240^\circ = \boxed{540^\circ}$.
